    "text": "<p>As per given figure, a weightless pulley <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is attached on a double inclined frictionless surface. The tension in the string (massless) will be (if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/43fe43ae-e219-4bf7-84af-3953c7ce449d-9893439.PNG\" style=\"width: 296px; height: 156px;\" /></p>",
