  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/804bd665-df71-4134-bb57-9a5ece22d193-43fe43ae-e219-4bf7-84af-3953c7ce449d-9893439.PNG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 158px;\" /></p><p>The magnitude of acceleration of both the blocks will be same and is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Applying Newton&#39;s second law for second block (along the direction parallel to the incline on which it is placed)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>",
